{"code":"028080","name":"휴맥스홀딩스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"전자제품","sector_desc":"생활 전자제품과 부품. 소비 경기와 수출 환경을 따릅니다.","desc":"동사는 1989년 전자장비 개발 시스템 제조 및 판매업 등을 영위할 목적으로 설립되었으며, 1997년 코스닥시장에 상장됨. 2009년 투자사업부문을 인적 분할하여 지주회사 체제로 전환하였으며, 현재 휴맥스그룹 소속으로 총 14개의 국내 계열회사를 보유하고 있음. 주요 자회사 ㈜휴맥스는 영상·음향기기, 가전제품, 자동차 부품, 전기차 충전기 개발 및 판매업을, ㈜누빅스는 ESG 규제 대응 플랫폼 및 솔루션 서비스업을 영위하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-16","n_days":300,"close":5170.0,"open":0.0,"high":0.0,"low":0.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":-100.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":1.9724,"ret_60":-10.2431,"ret_120":-31.25,"ret_250":-43.4726,"ma20":5192.5,"ma60":4994.75,"ma120":5948.3333,"ma200":6822.73,"close_vs_ma200":-24.2239,"close_vs_ma60":3.5087,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":23.9184,"r2_60":0.0466,"slope_120":-69.6224,"r2_120":0.6622,"slope_250":-48.5931,"r2_250":0.7265,"high52":12110.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":42.692,"dd_52w":-57.308,"mdd_1y":-57.2428,"atr14_pct":86.488,"vol_ann_60":45.6761,"vol_avg20":1348.65,"vol_ratio20":0.0,"vr5":0.0,"vr20":0.0545,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":7018778.0,"amount_avg60":13660729.8333,"obv_chg20":68.7688,"turnover_20":1.1113,"pv_eff_20":1.7748,"rsi14":54.2253,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":-1521.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0627,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0627,"frgn_net_60":-126.0,"inst_net_60":-283.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0052,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0117,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0169,"frgn_net_120":5623.0,"inst_net_120":-5015.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.2317,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.2066,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0251,"foreign_ratio":0.0,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-17.0,"op_margin_q":-1.5315,"op_qoq":-173.913,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":70.1754,"rev_yoy":-2.2026,"op_trend_4q":33.1313,"fin_period":"202606","roe":14.26,"debt_ratio":259.46,"per":2.19,"pbr":0.27,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":0.0,"target_price":null,"recomm":nul